<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cricket-Australia v Natal scoreboard.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Australia v Natal scoreboard.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final scoreboard of the cricket match between Natal and Australia at Kingsmead on Saturday:</p>
<p>Natal first innings 335 (Mark Bruyns 105, Dale Benkenstein 103; Jason Gillespie 4-71)</p>
<p>Australia first innings 370 (Mark Waugh 124, Michael Bevan 52; Pat Symcox 4-117)</p>
<p>Natal second innings (overnight 21-0)</p>
<p> D.Watson st Healy b Warne			     9</p>
<p> M.Bruyns c Healy b Warne			     20</p>
<p> E.Stewart not out					49</p>
<p> D.Crookes c Warne b Gillespie			 5</p>
